/-!
# Packet EQ-NONVAC (chunk D): `eq_flow_exists_proof`

Relocated proof of `HRS.MD.EQ29.eq_flow_exists` (frozen with its `sorry` in `HRS/MD/EQ29Spec.lean`; the tie
`HRS/MD/EQLawFlowTie.lean` checks that the statements agree).

Route: the Gibbs law `ℙ_{N,β}` is a probability measure (`q84d_gibbs_isProb`) on `Config d N` that gives no mass to the
collision set; `exists_enlargement_indep` gives the space `ℙ_{N,β} ⊗ Wiener` with the Brownian filtration generated by the
initial datum and the Wiener paths; `eqlaw_exists_filtered` (the proof of `exists_isStrongSolution_of_maximal` with the
adaptedness kept) gives a strong solution adapted and progressive for that filtration, and `pathwiseUnique_of_locLipschitz`
gives pathwise uniqueness; together with `particle_no_collision_dge2` (no exit) these are the fields of
`IsStationaryGibbsFlow`.
-/

noncomputable section

open MeasureTheory Filter Topology ProbabilityTheory
open scoped ENNReal NNReal BigOperators

